*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0038
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : A.W.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-07-15 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-10-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 181
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP090
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0038.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    05 BANKRUPTCY-FLAG    PIC X.
       88 BANKRUPTCY-BANKRUPT VALUE 'Y'.
    05 BK-YEARS           PIC 9(2).
    *> BUREAU CREDIT SCORE
    05 CR-SCORE           PIC 9(3).
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> A=APPROVE R=REFER D=DECLINE
    05 CREDIT-DECN        PIC X VALUE 'D'.
    05 DECN-REASON        PIC X(3) VALUE SPACES.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM BANKRUPTCY-CHECK
    DISPLAY "CREDIT-DECN=" CREDIT-DECN
    DISPLAY "DECN-REASON=" DECN-REASON
    STOP RUN.
BANKRUPTCY-CHECK.
    IF BANKRUPTCY-BANKRUPT
        EVALUATE TRUE
            WHEN BK-YEARS < 10
                MOVE 'D' TO CREDIT-DECN
                MOVE 'BK1' TO DECN-REASON
            WHEN OTHER
                MOVE 'R' TO CREDIT-DECN
                MOVE 'BK2' TO DECN-REASON
        END-EVALUATE
    END-IF.
